OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain clearing east during
OL,6,Fthe morning and becoming brighter from
OL,7,Fthe west. Sunny spells developing in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon with mostly clear skies
OL,9,Fby the end of the afternoon. Windy
OL,10,Faround the Aberdeenshire coast in
OL,11,Fmorning. Feeling cooler in west.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry and clear during the
OL,14,Fevening with light winds, a light
OL,15,Ffrost is likely but becoming cloudier
OL,16,Flater in the night with rain spreading
OL,17,Fnorth into Southern Aberdeenshire by
OL,18,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
