OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA bright start for Moray but
OL,6,Frain spreading north across all areas,
OL,7,Fpersistent at times in the east and
OL,8,Fbecoming windy here too. Perhaps
OL,9,Fclearer in the west later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRather
OL,12,Funsettled over the weekend despite a
OL,13,Fbright start on Saturday, rain and
OL,14,Fstrong winds spread east. Showery
OL,15,FSunday but accompanied by gales.
OL,16,FPerhaps a brighter day Monday, rain
OL,17,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
